{
  "_": "Starter pack seeded into the config on first install (config file absent + no backups). See config::build_starter_config. Every entry carries \"isStarter\": true so a future 'reset starter' or migration pass can identify seeded rows. Unassigned Library section is auto-expanded on first install via Sidebar.jsx's default-false state (no localStorage key yet). Pack C radial segments are INLINE GLOBAL::RADIAL:: assignments (independent copies of the same actions in Pack A) — the radial editor pane doesn't currently render the linked action from a Default::UNASSIGNED::-pointing segment, so inline keeps the editor UX working. Each Pack C segment carries a distinct lucide icon + colour so users can immediately see icons+colours are customisable. Expansion data.html fields carry the exact editor-DOM shape (rte-token spans + <br> line breaks) so RichTextEditor.innerHTML paint isn't blank; date/time tokens must use the whitelisted literal-string grammar in expansions.rs (e.g. `{date:D MMMM YYYY}`, `{time:HH:MM}` — NOT strftime like `{date:%H:%M}`).",
  "starterPackVersion": 1,

  "expansionCategories": [
    { "name": "Starter", "colour": "#e8a020" }
  ],

  "searchTemplateCategories": [
    { "name": "Starter", "colour": "#e8a020" }
  ],

  "quickActionCategories": [
    { "name": "Starter", "colour": "#e8a020" }
